        "reading": "乘勝奔逐失後援，圍中被殺，報三十三。",
        "note": "乘勝奔逐失後援，圍中被殺，報三十三。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 65,
        "end_codepoint": 116,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-116",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "高祖深加痛悼，追贈青州刺史。",
        "reading": "劉裕痛悼，追贈青州刺史。",
        "note": "劉裕痛悼，追贈青州刺史。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 116,
        "end_codepoint": 130,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-130",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "又表曰：「故龍驤將軍、廣川太守孟龍符，忠勇果毅，隕身王事，宜蒙甄表，以顯貞節，聖恩嘉悼，寵贈方州。",
        "reading": "劉裕上表追述死者故官，言已得追贈。",
        "note": "劉裕上表追述死者故官，言已得追贈。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 130,
        "end_codepoint": 179,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-179",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "龍符投袂義初，前驅效命，推鋒三捷，每為眾先。",
        "reading": "表追敘義旗三捷。",
        "note": "表追敘義旗三捷。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 179,
        "end_codepoint": 201,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-201",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "及西劋桓歆，北殄索虜，朝議爵賞，未及施行。",
        "reading": "西征桓歆與北討索虜後，爵賞未行。",
        "note": "西征桓歆與北討索虜後，爵賞未行。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 201,
        "end_codepoint": 222,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-222",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "會今北伐，復統前旅，臨朐之戰，氣冠三軍。",
        "reading": "表稱此役北伐任前鋒。",
        "note": "表稱此役北伐任前鋒。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 222,
        "end_codepoint": 242,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-242",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "于時逆徒實繁，控弦掩澤，龍符匹馬電躍，所向摧靡，奮戈深入，知死弗吝。",
        "reading": "表述龍符深入燕騎。",
        "note": "表述龍符深入燕騎。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 242,
        "end_codepoint": 276,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-047-menglongfu:received_sentence2-276",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA",
        "source_quote": "賊超奔遁，依險鳥聚，大軍因勢，方軌長驅。",
        "reading": "慕容超奔遁，晉軍長驅。",
        "note": "慕容超奔遁，晉軍長驅。",
